# Friday Memory Backup - Git Ignore

# === 排除敏感文件 ===
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
**/.env
**/secrets/
**/tokens/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# === 排除系统文件 ===
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# === 排除编辑器和 IDE ===
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-*

# === 排除 Node/Python 缓存 ===
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.cache/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo

# === 排除 OpenClaw 内部状态文件 ===
.openclaw/
.clawhub/
.workspace-state.json

# === 排除 Skills 目录（技能会单独管理） ===
skills/

# === 排除临时和测试文件 ===
friday_agent/
friday_memory/
friday_voice_test.mp3
*.mp3
*.wav

# === 排除记忆系统的内部索引文件（只保留 Markdown） ===
memory/stm/
memory/vectors/
memory/reflections/
**/vector_index.json
**/ngram_index.json
**/pattern_index.json

# === 排除脚本 ===
scripts/

# === 保留的核心文件 ===
# ✅ AGENTS.md
# ✅ SOUL.md
# ✅ USER.md
# ✅ IDENTITY.md
# ✅ TOOLS.md
# ✅ HEARTBEAT.md
# ✅ README.md
# ✅ memory/*.md (每日记忆日志)
# ✅ MEMORY.md (长期记忆)
